      "copy_notes": [
        "the shared Employee Zero base every ordinary employee role file specialises",
        "TEMPLATE PARTS ONLY. The packet names the directory; at build time it also contained one employee's instance state -- a named assignment, a journal entry, an append-only ledger and an absolute assignment workspace -- which D266 forbids shipping to another user. The same template-parts rule the packet states for chief/ is applied here, and the deviation is recorded in MANIFEST.lock.json.",
        "project and employee templates, kept in their own subfolders (D298)",
        "registry documentation; the concrete records/ entries are not shipped",
        "registry generator/reconciler; it resolves ROOT as its own parent's parent, which is why factory/ keeps the source-relative layout",
        "Credential-free shared participant API. Per-instance endpoint packets and credentials are created on the target outside the checkout.",
        "Manager-side supported Board delegation seam; target-local credential roots remain external to the release tree.",
        "the Chief package: TEMPLATE PARTS ONLY (Packet P5-1, D266). The source package's journal/, decisions.md, outputs/ and state/assignment.json are one employee's accumulated memory and work; shipping them would hand one user's history to another. It is a copy spec inside the factory component, not a fifth component, because it is pinned to the same source and commit as the rest of the Factory."
      ],
